01:05:50.650 --> 01:05:55.170
<v Ai 1>I'll see your two dots and raise you-- nothing.

01:05:55.170 --> 01:06:00.170
<v Ira Glass>That is not how you play that game. I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
